    <Cell ss:StyleID="WrapTextCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Rolling hero statements (facades, homes, masalas, brands, stays, identities); parent group value proposition; 5 sector preview blurbs; verified key enterprise figures (founding year 2010, 4 operating hubs, manufacturing capacity).</Data></Cell>
