    <Cell ss:StyleID="WrapTextCell"><Data ss:Type="String">16-year corporate narrative (2010 founding to multi-sector enterprise); 6 core value descriptions (Faith, Trust, Foundation, People, Process, Service); chronological milestones timeline (2010, 2014, 2018, 2021, 2024); bios for 7 executive directors.</Data></Cell>
