    <Cell ss:StyleID="OwnerCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Technical Quality &amp; EHS Desks</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="WrapTextCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Detailed copy for 3 operational sustainability pillars: 1. High-performance building skins (thermal breaks, SHGC, HVAC energy cuts); 2. Clean botanical processing (chemical-free cold milling, optical sortation, allergen control); 3. Vocational trade safety (School of Facade Technologies fall-arrest rigging, crane safety).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="WrapTextCell"><Data ss:Type="String">HVAC load cut percentage (up to 28%), Solar Heat Gain Coefficient (&lt; 0.25), cold milling temperature (&lt; 42°C), volatile oil retention (&gt; 99.2%), annual certified technicians (80+).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="WrapTextCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Close-up of double-glazed curtain wall thermal break, stone milling bay at Bavla, facade training workshop benches.</Data></Cell>
